data: {"id": "bff916946cb742da-thinking-parallel_evidence-1156", "run_id": "bff916946cb742da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我对整个局面有了清晰的认知，可以完成证据结论。\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 结果 | 对候选原因的支持/反驳 |\n|------|------|----------------------|\n| **Pod 状态** | `phase=Pending`，`nodeName: <none>` | 确认 Pod 仍处于 Pending 状态，未调度到任何节点 |\n| **Prometheus 指标** | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1`，所有其他 phase=0 | 与 kubectl 结果一致，确认当前仍在 Pending |\n| **调度事件** | `Warning FailedScheduling`：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` | 直接指向调度失败原因 |\n| **Pod 调度约束** | `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"t", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788408138470, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

