data: {"id": "bff916946cb742da-thinking-parallel_evidence-1656", "run_id": "bff916946cb742da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 失败修正结果\n\n### 1. query_pod_logs 修正调用结果\n- **原始错误**：`elasticsearch_error` — 是 Elasticsearch 集群 (`elasticsearch-master-0` in `monitor` namespace) 的权限问题，不是目标 Pod 本身的日志查询失败。\n- **修正后调用**：`query_pod_logs` 返回 `coverage: error`, `status: query_rejected`, `normalized: 0, returned: 0`。这表示 Elasticsearch 后端仍因权限限制无法访问。\n- **有效信息**：`pod_uid: c54b3bab-76ec-47fa-934e-04a8b48cae1a` 已确认，index 为 `filebeat-*`。\n- **结论**：Logging 维度**因 Elasticsearch 集群权限问题无法获取数据**，保留此边界。\n\n### 2. Pod 状态确认（kubectl_describe 成功）\n- **状态**: ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788408149015, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

